; Build probes. Each names the Aura behaviour this repository depends on, so
; a build that no longer has it says which one instead of failing somewhere
; deep in a run.
;   named-let reentrancy - Aura main (#5102) returns the first call's result
;     from every later call of the same loop.
;     https://github.com/cybrid-systems/aura/issues/5116
;   the mutate-verb snapshot op - the v0.2.1 primitive split moved snapshot /
;     restore under (mutate …) and closed the ast: prefix; without it the
;     autotune dies when it commits a candidate.
;     https://github.com/cybrid-systems/aura/issues/5118
; Supported build: Aura v0.2.0, nightly cf7353373.

(require "lib/perf/util" all:)

(if (perf:named-let-reentrant?)
    (display "named-let-reentrant\n")
    (error (perf:named-let-fault-text)))

(if (perf:mutate-ops-present?)
    (display "mutate-ops-present\n")
    (error (perf:mutate-ops-fault-text)))
